  "body": " As a simple example of how we use the arithmetic of series Theorem , consider We recognize that we know how to compute parts of this sum. We know that because it is a geometric series (Example and Lemma ) with first term and ratio . And we know that by Example . We can now use Theorem to build the specified complicated series out of these two simple pieces.   "
