  "body": " Every student who comes to class brings their instructor cookies, and leaves them on the instructor's desk. Let be the total number of cookies on the instructor's desk after the th student comes.  If , and , what does represent?  Note is the cumulative number of cookies.  All together, there were 36 cookies brought by Student 11 through Student 20.  After twenty students have brought their cookies, the pile numbers 53 cookies. 17 of these cookies were brought by students one through ten. So, the remainder ( ) is the number of cookies brought by students 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, and 20, together.     "
