  "title": "(✳).",
  "body": "2015A  Determine whether the series is absolutely convergent, conditionally convergent, or divergent; justify your answer.  Conditionally convergent  The series converges by the alternating series test. On the other hand the series diverges by the limit comparison test with . So the given series is conditionally convergent.  "
