  "title": "(✳).",
  "body": "2016Q6  Determine whether the series is absolutely convergent, conditionally convergent, or divergent.  Be careful about the signs.  The series diverges.  Note that . So we can simplify Since , diverges by the comparison test with the divergent harmonic series . The extra overall factor of in the original series does not change the conclusion of divergence.   "
