  "body": " Below is a graph of , along with the constant approximation, linear approximation, and quadratic approximation centred at . Which is which?     Which of the functions are constant, linear, and quadratic?   : linear   : constant   : quadratic  All functions , , and intersect the function when . is a constant function, so this is the constant approximation. is the tangent line, so is the linear approximation. is a tangent parabola, so is the quadratic approximation.  "
