  "body": "Long Division  Once you have found a root of a polynomial, even if you cannot factor out of the polynomial by inspection, you can find by dividing by , using the long division algorithm you learned This is a standard part of most highschool mathematics curricula, but perhaps not all. You should revise this carefully. in school, but with replaced by .  "
